  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently you can only generate impostors from the website. It would be nice to also be able to do this from the SDK so that people don't need to also login to the website to generate impostors.\n\nA minor change, but it's just relevant to what I'm proposing which is basically just \"bring the website to parity with the SDK in terms of content management\", which is why I also made this post: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/allow-editing-of-names-descriptions-and-tags-for-avatars-from-the-website\n\nIf generating impostors will eventually be automatic and done to all avatars then I guess this particular suggestion will soon be obsolete, but I thought I'd toss it out there in case you intend to keep it as a manual process.\n\nThanks.",
